proposals/ contains draft WASI interface proposals (wasi-canvas, wasi-audio,
wasi-input-handlers and others) authored for, or adapted for, this project. WASI
proposals upstream are published under the Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exception;
where a file here originates upstream it retains that heading. Anything intended for
upstreaming should carry the LLVM Exception so it can be contributed without
relicensing.

wit/ contains the wandr:* interface packages, and wit/deps-upstream/ vendors
third-party WIT packages that keep their own licenses.
